# This repo runs with autocrlf, which rewrites files on checkout. A shell script
# that comes back with CRLF line endings fails with a bad-interpreter error, so
# pin the ones that must stay LF. index.html and STATUS.md are generated with LF
# and compared byte-for-byte by update.sh's no-change check, so pin them too --
# otherwise every checkout would look like a change and the routine would commit
# noise daily.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
